yle="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Specialty Property &amp; Casualty Insurance</span></td><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Insurance Distribution</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Corporate &amp; Other</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Eliminations </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:3.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.1pt;vertical-align:baseline">(3)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Total</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Specialty Property &amp; Casualty Insurance</span></td><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times 